<title>TURKEY: TURKEY TO OFFER 25,000 T SUGAR FOR IRAQI TENDER.</title>
<headline>TURKEY TO OFFER 25,000 T SUGAR FOR IRAQI TENDER.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's state sugar refiner Turkseker will offer 25,000 tonnes of whites for an Iraqi tender to buy 120,000 tonnes under a U.N.-monitored oil-for-food plan, company manager Selahattin Hun said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
